      "experiment_id": "exp_1",
      "description": "Hybrid quantum-classical loan collection optimization on a real proprietary Kasikornbank dataset, using divide-and-conquer community detection, QAOA on each subproblem, and greedy provision reduction to reduce LLP while maximizing expected net profit and network welfare.",
      "algorithm": {
        "family": "hybrid",
